      'Enumeration as Matt finds Webmin 1.910, vulnerable to CVE-2019-15107: the password-change endpoint executes commands even in useful unauthenticated/authenticated edge cases (the public exploit uses the password_change.cgi with a crafted expired-password flow). Run the exploit and catch the callback as root — Webmin runs privileged, so RCE equals root directly.',
